cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, cite the associated article."
type: software
title: "FAIR-AL: reference implementation for auditing demographic query drift in feature-based ASD screening"
abstract: >-
  Acquisition rules, strict paired-comparison statistics and table builders for the
  revision of manuscript CMPB-D-26-04362. The code audits and controls demographic
  query drift in active learning over feature-based autism screening data; it contains no
  participant-level data. Python package version 0.8.0; release tag cmpb-rev1-v1.0.1.
version: "cmpb-rev1-v1.0.1"
date-released: "2026-11-13"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mindloop-lab/fair-al"
